8.1 **Governing Law**  
This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to its conflict of law principles.

8.2 **Dispute Resolution**  
Any disputes arising out of or related to this Agreement shall be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association. The arbitration shall take place in Wilmington, Delaware.

8.3 **Entire Agreement**  
This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the Parties and supersedes all prior discussions, agreements, or understandings of any kind.

