**EXHIBIT A** – Performance Bonus Structure  
1. Performance bonuses shall be based on the following criteria:  
   a. Successful implementation of the Inventory Management System by the deadline.  
   b. Achievement of a customer satisfaction rating of at least 85% within six months of deploying Customer Service Protocols.  
   c. Increase in inventory turnover ratio by at least 20% within the first year.  

2. The bonus amount shall be prorated based on the percentage of criteria met.  
3. E-Comm Dynamics shall submit a report to Retail Solutions detailing the performance metrics, upon which the bonus will be calculated.

